[{"title":"沁园春•题影，赠吴中友人","author":"彭孙遹","text":"其状若何，珠玉为容，冰雪为肠。\n问对朕者谁，心知沤露，如卿有几，手淬风霜。\n读损羲爻，搜奇禹简，探得灵威字数行。\n低回处，叹无情山水，阅尽兴亡。\n悲歌慷慨苍凉。\n正散发、行吟白日长。\n尽家徒四壁，贫如司马，目空一世，狂甚袁羊。\n奇服灵均，高冠子夏，杂佩缤纷菃若香。\n身名事，付杯中醽醁，枕畔沧浪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42512,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沁园春•和韵答金峤庵","author":"彭孙遹","text":"往古来今，如许英雄，钟鼎旂常。\n尽飘风冷雨，馀声销灭，寒烟蔓草，陈迹苍茫。\n南顾昆明，东瞻闽越，二十年来一战场。\n到今日，喜丰年多黍，兵气销光。\n溪山老我何伤。\n且买醉、时探肘后囊。\n须我歌若舞，乌乌击缶，倡予和汝，款款飞觞。\n仆射不如，尚书不顾，羯鼓频催不记行。\n才倾倒，早一轮红日，涌上扶桑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42513,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贺新郎•酌酒与孙默，用稼轩韵","author":"彭孙遹","text":"笑谓君休矣。\n算人生、重茵列鼎，为时能几。\n趁取新凉今夜好，一醉破除万事。\n尽酒后、沾沾自喜。\n赋笔凌云谁见赏，只子虚乌有公无是。\n更谁荐，雄文似。\n休官且卧烟霞里。\n又何须、虎头食肉，马肝知味。\n速筑糟丘吾将老，得丧由来一理。\n纵狂歌、东方月起。\n驹隙光阴河射角，叹羊肠、仕路车生耳。\n且引尽，黄山子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42514,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白苧•春暮","author":"彭孙遹","text":"雨乍晴，又洗出，满庭葱茜。\n金铃风急，惊起啄花乳燕。\n袅柔条、断送了落红如霰。\n迟日。\n正暄妍，飏游丝、钗头轻罥。\n扑蝶归来，不觉玉弓酸软。\n早安排、送春小会樱桃宴。\n深院。\n密坐相逢，低声问取，可似多情荀倩。\n却无语回眸，眼波一线。\n月明人静，待寻欢良夜，阑干敲遍。\n金斗放声频，多应细熨裙花茜。\n五丝幢下，明日酬私愿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42515,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画屏秋色•芜城秋感","author":"彭孙遹","text":"野照芜城夕。\n送远目、云水苍茫不极。\n琼蕊音遥，青楼梦杳，玉钩人寂。\n何处认隋宫、见衰草寒烟堆积。\n攒一片、伤心碧。\n听柳外哀蝉，风高响滞，如诉兴亡旧恨，声声无力。\n今昔。\n可胜悽恻。\n莫重问、锦帆消息。\n竹西歌吹，淮南笙鹤，尽成陈迹。\n转眼又西风，辞巢越燕还如客。\n落叶千重萧槭。\n万事总销沉，唯有清江皓月，曾照昔人颜色。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42516,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小诺皋•维扬旅舍闻蝉","author":"彭孙遹","text":"碧藓庭除，绿阴城郭，雨过空苍如洗。\n正疏林、两两鸣蝉，高低声递。\n何待移宫换羽，嶰竹天然相比。\n戛馀音、还共南薰摇曳。\n客去茶清，棋残香细。\n故搅人、北窗好梦，一觉扬州惊起。\n欹枕处，偏清厉。\n托体高枝，翳形密叶，直是如羹如沸。\n总不管、西候羁情，南冠客意。\n似水流光暗逝，渐入深秋天气。\n转眼向、孤雁寒蛩更替。\n玄鬓凋残，白头憔悴。\n试临风、独凭栏干，侧耳哀吟此际。\n容易使，秋心碎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42517,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哨遍•春情和东坡韵","author":"彭孙遹","text":"拾翠年时，踏青节候，芳草纷铺地。\n弄阴晴，景色遍园林，屈指到清明天气。\n小池边，紫燕欲寻新垒。\n红襟对掠桃花水。\n正山杏笼烟，海棠经雨，秾艳天然无比。\n映高楼何处绿杨枝，又搓得鹅黄千尺丝。\n总酿就、迷花病酒，怀人几般滋味。\n素手好同携，郁金屏外朱栏里。\n欲诉绸缪，鹦鹉生憎忒伶俐。\n看弱不胜衣，柔如无骨，仙裾怕逐东风起。\n墨染乌阑，袖沾红唾，脉脉春愁无际。\n渐画烛烧残繁英飞。\n坠似绮丛蛱蝶向花低。\n忙不了、窃香私意。\n任取粉销春老，一梦消身世。\n蓬莱水浅，沧海尘扬，毕竟此情难已。\n九天莺鹤倘相招，为报人生行乐耳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42518,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鸾啼序•夏景","author":"彭孙遹","text":"半枕新凉，破好梦一声白鸟。\n远钟歇、曙色霏微，残莺啼上林杪。\n帘幕重重、次第捲，云屏曲曲潇湘晓。\n看露浓香细茉莉，又开多少。\n浅晕才施，薄铅不御，衫子裁纤缟。\n更青青、非雾非烟，眉山两点慵扫。\n倚纱窗、梧竹澄鲜，弄薰风、悠扬未了。\n正深闺永昼如年，问津谁到。\n南园此日，满地绿阴亏蔽，有芳蕖曲沼。\n乍微雨收痕，翠盖孤擎，红衣双笑。\n冰井敲残，纹楸弹罢，倦听高柳玄蝉噪。\n觉小院无人愈清悄。\n簟纹似水，琅玕几度欹眠，钗凤坠盘云搅。\n归来庭户，娇困难禁，绣带罗裙袅。\n最是温泉新浴，玉软花慵，侍儿扶起，风姿偏好。\n晚凉初荐，轻容重换，碧栏干外梳头处，恰团圆、好月来相照。\n坐看夜色天阶，戏扑流萤，轻罗扇小。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42519,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"少年游•春恨","author":"彭孙遹","text":"晓烟未敛，春池欲皱，花影压回廊。\n淡日窥帘，深寒着枕，曾否试新妆。\n阑干敲遍无人应，颠倒费思量。\n燕子衔花，呢喃不住，来去自双双。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42520,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"閒中好•闺夏","author":"董以宁","text":"閒中好，茉莉香中坐，珠汗怕沾纱。\n红绒罢绣花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42521,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶杯•相逢曲","author":"董以宁","text":"若个粉郎娇艳。\n当面。\n多事一凝眸。\n恰逢小妹乍回头。\n羞么羞。\n羞么羞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42522,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔歌子•相思曲","author":"董以宁","text":"银蒜低垂睡起迟。\n楝花天气耐相思。\n羞对镜，怯吟诗。\n午倦添香入被池。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42523,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"捣练子•桥头","author":"董以宁","text":"金作勒，玉为羁。\n小马惊香何处嘶。\n红板桥头扉半掩，几丝杨柳挂黄鹂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42524,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南•叩叩词","author":"董以宁","text":"章台女，叩叩结新欢。\n堂下每迎花底笑，人前私向镜中看。\n可许一生拚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42525,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙•春闺","author":"董以宁","text":"东风庭院暗香恬。\n半树梨花压画檐。\n眉黛无端簇一尖。\n晚愁添。\n细雨潇潇不捲帘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42526,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令•赋别","author":"董以宁","text":"绮语和郎细诵。\n红袖半肩轻拥。\n忘却漏声催，早是信鸡催送。\n珍重。\n珍重。\n此去画桥霜冻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42527,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风流子•久别","author":"董以宁","text":"已是别时惆怅。\n更是而今惝恍。\n空寄语，未逢欢，愁被春风吹长。\n自怜一样。\n眼角眉梢心上。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42528,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思•舟泊","author":"董以宁","text":"片云留。\n片云流。\n水远山长客子愁。\n如何是尽头。\n一孤洲。\n一孤舟。\n憔悴天涯黑敝裘。\n相思玳瑁楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42529,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望梅花•过鹦鹉洲","author":"董以宁","text":"芳草萋萋如画。\n唤起祢生閒话。\n死向风波曾不怕。\n长裤请君穿罢。\n除是阿瞒还值骂。\n黄祖不堪君诧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42530,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"调笑令•赋张巡妾","author":"董以宁","text":"记取。\n和君语。\n自读睢阳闻笛句。\n纵馀黄土无归处。\n莫洒双双红箸。\n愿日后携侬巾帼，二十四城传去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42531,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉太平•寿玉虬叔三十叔别号云痴","author":"董以宁","text":"苏仙李仙。\n张颠米颠。\n其诗其字之间。\n许云痴并肩。\n书帘茗烟。\n琴弦画笺。\n年年长向花前。\n著金貂醉眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42532,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感恩多•鸿信","author":"董以宁","text":"昨夜传鸿信。\n雨后花扶病。\n兼传病有因。\n为郎颦。\n忒觉情多，真假转难分。\n转难分。\n便是空言，忍猜他未真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42533,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子•柬内","author":"董以宁","text":"伴绣小青鬟，生性由来好。\n惯得阿侬怜，不累伊家恼。\n茶灶倩他炊，药臼亏他捣。\n莫做阮咸姑，休学王珉嫂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42534,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子•临淮舟次集唐","author":"董以宁","text":"不见有人烟，人烟隔水见。\n寒苇露船灯，野火明沙岸。\n月晚树阴多，浦迥湘云捲。\n坐看云起时，吴山中路断。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42535,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉公子•挑棋","author":"董以宁","text":"小姑敛衽拜。\n嫂嫂妆台下。\n乞早整莲衣，花间去赌棋。\n杏钗多戴个，停会来输我。\n若倩小哥帮。\n输时拔一双。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42536,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉公子•重来","author":"董以宁","text":"乍握纤纤手。\n侬意他知否。\n莫便使他知，教他归去思。\n重来花下见。\n红晕潮生面。\n纤手只微笼，多时露玉葱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42537,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉公子•赋艳","author":"董以宁","text":"侬心何事恼。\n姐姐欺侬小。\n偷看合欢书，憎侬问起居。\n好从花下避，怕见书中字。\n匿笑不回头，回头替姐羞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42538,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇•江晚","author":"董以宁","text":"去去江舟，烟中山色浑无据。\n落云迎屿。\n雁向潇湘去。\n晚浦观渔，不辨渔人语。\n花如絮。\n月芦深处。\n那里汀头住。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42539,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇•消閒","author":"董以宁","text":"无可消閒，不愁怎得光阴过。\n绿窗赓和。\n佯说愁城大。\n强约愁来，愁也来何莫。\n曾经么。\n和衣独卧。\n今夜愁真个。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42540,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇•闺思","author":"董以宁","text":"翠被葡萄，轻笼金鸭香烟重。\n梅花影动。\n小阁寒宵共。\n到得而今，无计凰求凤。\n愁千种。\n一场春梦。\n又被灯花哄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42541,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇•旅赠","author":"董以宁","text":"旅馆黄昏，檠灯襆被钟声悄。\n心烟缥缈。\n只是随郎袅。\n眉语低时，暗计行程早。\n如何好。\n画眉虽巧。\n五日张京兆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42542,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"女冠子•春闺","author":"董以宁","text":"柳绵吹怯。\n不费东风着力。\n看来迟。\n曲沼经行处，回廊遍倚时。\n鸳鸯游冶子，鹦鹉滑稽儿。\n见人消瘦尽，笑人痴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42543,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱•晓","author":"董以宁","text":"幽梦宵来托锦胶。\n起看杂树已花交。\n不禁莲瓣一轻敲。\n盥手试香按豆蔻，开奁占喜得蟏蛸。\n绣床针帖尚閒抛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42544,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱•夜","author":"董以宁","text":"淡月回廊几处湾。\n花阴潜入候双镮。\n残灯明灭未曾还。\n落绣正窥金约腕，罢妆犹系玉连环。\n一重屈戌隔蓬山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42545,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱•赋别梁溪主人","author":"董以宁","text":"十里珠帘正冶游。\n好乘青雀下苏州。\n双银曾寄杏花楼。\n爱尔一樽桑落酒，迟予三日木兰舟。\n春风寒到紫鼷裘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42546,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱•闺思集句","author":"董以宁","text":"欲作家书意万重。\n美人千里思何穷。\n眼看春尽不相逢。\n几处吹笳明月夜，一声肠断绣帷中。\n秋波不动簟纹融。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42547,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花•村落","author":"董以宁","text":"柴门傍岸。\n白板双桥连曲断。\n水涨花溪。\n一夜东风没钓矶。\n渔童叉髻。\n待攀细柳穿双鲤。\n细柳条条。\n拖得黄鹂拂板桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42548,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮  生拚","author":"董以宁","text":"怪郎昨夜欺奴甚。\n生拚独就红蕤枕。\n脉脉转银河。\n郎将妾奈何。\n心肠毕竟软。\n渐褪罗襦半。\n不觉响流苏。\n双鬟睡去无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42549,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮•舟次集唐","author":"董以宁","text":"一樽酒尽青山暮。\n雨昏青草湖边过。\n沙浅浪痕交。\n云帆碍浦桥。\n潮平两岸阔。\n古木疑撑月。\n何事与心违。\n潇湘人未归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42550,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮•代伊","author":"董以宁","text":"阿娘碎语绵如絮。\n檀郎只好心头贮。\n音信日来稀。\n思伊转恨伊。\n此情频欲寄。\n又恐伤郎意。\n斟酌数行书。\n言欢字字虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42551,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子•雪江晴月","author":"董以宁","text":"明月淡飞琼，阴云薄中酒。\n收尽盈盈舞絮飘，点点轻鸥咒。\n晴浦晚风寒，青山玉骨瘦。\n回看亭亭雪映窗，淡淡烟垂岫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42552,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巫山一段云","author":"董以宁","text":"岫垂烟淡淡，窗映雪亭亭。\n看回瘦骨玉山青，寒风晚浦晴。\n咒鸥轻点点，飘絮舞盈盈。\n尽收酒中薄云阴，琼飞淡月明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42553,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丑奴儿令•闺怨","author":"董以宁","text":"欢情别恨匆匆换，欢是前宵。\n别是今朝。\n一样轻魂两样销。\n梦来梦去迢迢觅，去梦郎招。\n来梦奴邀。\n两处轻魂一处飘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42554,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉太平•金钱卜","author":"董以宁","text":"鹊儿不断。\n灯儿不管。\n紫姑仙不曾明判。\n掷金钱再算。\n青蚨飞去还飞转。\n只郎去、归偏缓。\n待点六爻还未半。\n奈心丝先乱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42555,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐•私语","author":"董以宁","text":"已将身许。\n敢比风中絮。\n可奈檀郎疑又虑。\n未肯信侬言语。\n便将一缕心烟。\n花间敛衽告天。\n若负小窗欢约，来生丑似无盐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42556,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"占春芳•金盆濯发","author":"董以宁","text":"看翠雨，香缭绕，乱绾正三分。\n斜插牙梳欲堕，云边钩月初新。\n待洗忽含颦。\n为檀郎、银剪留痕。\n遮藏且唤双鬟去，莫捧金盆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42557,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相思引•为云孙咏侍儿小福","author":"董以宁","text":"年纪花梢半未谙。\n柔情先似再眠蚕。\n偏将串结，珍重叠香函。\n閒伴夫人同斗草，沉思未敢摘宜男。\n郎情深浅，还向梦回参。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42558,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥•堪讶","author":"董以宁","text":"殊堪讶。\n自将阿骛无端嫁。\n无端嫁。\n留他不得，掉他不下。\n眤人秋水临行泻。\n旧时团扇应难舍。\n应难舍。\n看他明日，耐他今夜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42559,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥•闺怨","author":"董以宁","text":"迎风哢。\n隔帘长自莺声鬨。\n莺声鬨。\n起来无力，睡来无梦。\n记得当年南浦送。\n双斟鹊脑情千种。\n情千种。\n低眉款语，几声珍重。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42560,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥•鹦哥","author":"董以宁","text":"猫来也。\n鹦哥唤道哥哥打。\n哥哥打。\n声声忏悔，摩诃般若。\n美人怜惜愁偏惹。\n粉盂喂肉犀帘下。\n犀帘下。\n金笼半启，雪衣轻洒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42561,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥•冶游","author":"董以宁","text":"郎君去。\n郎君骏马谁家住。\n谁家住。\n垆前绿酒，床前红炬。\n游丝欲系春风絮。\n睡花蝴蝶痴情绪。\n痴情绪。\n千金博得，明眸一觑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42562,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•夏日课婢掌书","author":"董以宁","text":"几床书卷散牙签。\n閒时信手常拈。\n抛来高枕帙谁缄。\n好倩纤纤。\n莫把燃脂污染，还将辟蠹香添。\n频频亲捧向冰帘。\n一卷楞严。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42563,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•浣葛","author":"董以宁","text":"衣纹单复尽能匀。\n怜伊大好腰身。\n那堪常傍葛衣尘。\n酒污馀痕。\n凭向银床漫洗，任教莲杵频闻。\n桁边风透帐边熏。\n一缕氤氲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42564,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•浇花","author":"董以宁","text":"为怜春去惜芳菲。\n将泉欲滴花枝。\n秃襟小袖汲来迟。\n别样腰肢。\n细洒恐溅裙幅，徐倾好沁香脾。\n一枝轻摘衬乌丝。\n拣又多时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42565,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•晒药","author":"董以宁","text":"茂陵消渴未全瘥。\n奁中药裹偏多。\n一丸休认枕边挼。\n错皱双蛾。\n晒久频移花影，暄侵小褪香罗。\n窃来休向桂婆娑。\n伴了姮娥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42566,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•烹茶","author":"董以宁","text":"落花风里绿烟轻。\n听来细细涛声。\n凭携方曲向茶铛。\n蟹眼时烹。\n洗处轻攒素笋，尝时小破朱樱。\n定瓷亲捧更盈盈。\n仙掌初倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42567,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•挥扇","author":"董以宁","text":"满庭花影日光烘。\n芳姿挟扇偏慵。\n唤来珠汗正融融。\n细舀荷风。\n拂去篆烟缥缈，捉来玉指菁葱。\n淡红耙袜映酥胸。\n微样轻容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42568,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•侍浴","author":"董以宁","text":"堕鬟初卸拭轻纨。\n绿云回手重盘。\n笑郎新沐髻如丸。\n何日弹冠。\n半晌劳挼澡豆，几回羞倚阑干。\n待穿犊鼻好同看。\n月挂林端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42569,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画堂春•拂簟","author":"董以宁","text":"冰丝簟子出蕲州。\n铺来湘水平流。\n为郎拂拭向纱帱。\n凉沁如秋。\n每到宵来重展，却怜晓起偏羞。\n臂痕人讶细纹留。\n今夜拚休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42570,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜迁莺•染甲","author":"董以宁","text":"拈金凤，捣朱砂。\n纤指染红葩。\n殷勤捧得玉瓯茶。\n光映绿沉瓜。\n莫轻弹，休更剪。\n夜半搔时谁见。\n落霞琴上不曾差。\n流水泛桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42571,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海棠春•闺词，补和程村阮亭韵 晓妆","author":"董以宁","text":"画楼檐马琤琮响。\n花几片、乱飘蛛网。\n日射水晶帘，影动波纹漾。\n牡丹松髻梳新样。\n为镜里、人儿心赏。\n薄帨贮犀帘，娇额风前敞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42572,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海棠春•午睡","author":"董以宁","text":"夜来花睡何曾足。\n把往事、欲抛心曲。\n欹枕小钗横，软衬芙蓉褥。\n衣痕细细肌匀肉，半醒处、咳成珠玉。\n唤煮鹧鸪茶，烟漾纱窗竹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42573,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]